1
00:00:00,229 --> 00:00:03,289
(Leonard:)You are unbelievable.
I don't know why I put up with you.

2
00:00:03,499 --> 00:00:08,099
(Leonard:)- You're controlling, you're irritating...
- There you go again. Nag, nag, nag.

3
00:00:09,105 --> 00:00:11,305
(Sheldon:)You're only proving my point, little lady.

4
00:00:12,442 --> 00:00:14,142
You know what, screw you, Sheldon.

5
00:00:14,377 --> 00:00:16,747
You're the most annoying person
I've ever met.

6
00:00:16,946 --> 00:00:20,906
(Sheldon:)I'm annoying?
You criticize my behavior all the time.

7
00:00:21,117 --> 00:00:25,147
"Sheldon, don't talk about
your bowel movements over breakfast."

8
00:00:25,388 --> 00:00:27,618
"Sheldon, when the president
of the university...

9
00:00:27,824 --> 00:00:31,594
(Sheldon:)...is giving a eulogy at a funeral,
don't yawn and point at your watch."

10
00:00:31,794 --> 00:00:34,624
"Sheldon, don't throw away my shirts
because they're ugly."

11
00:00:34,831 --> 00:00:36,131
(Sheldon:)You're impossible.

12
00:00:37,166 --> 00:00:39,196
That's it, I don't have to put up with this.

13
00:00:39,435 --> 00:00:43,395
(Sheldon:)Actually, I have your signature
on a roommate agreement that says you do.

14
00:00:43,573 --> 00:00:47,133
Aww. Here's what I think
of your roommate agreement.

15
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:53,040
- You pick that up right now.
- No.

16
00:00:53,282 --> 00:00:55,272
(Sheldon:)Roommate agreement,
section 27, paragraph 5:

17
00:00:55,485 --> 00:00:59,315
"The roommate agreement, like the
American flag, cannot touch the ground."

18
00:01:00,456 --> 00:01:02,016
(Leonard:)I don't care.

19
00:01:02,225 --> 00:01:07,725
(Leonard:)I don't have to do anything you say, because
I don't think I wanna live here anymore.

20
00:01:08,531 --> 00:01:10,621
- Where are you going?
- To live with Penny...

21
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:12,290
(Leonard:)...not you, you crazy bastard.

22
00:01:12,502 --> 00:01:14,472
- Crazy bastard?
- Yes.

23
00:01:15,371 --> 00:01:17,071
- Leonard, wait.
- What?

24
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:25,020
(Sheldon:)Dobby the Elf dies in book seven.

